{"id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-gale-stewart.md","title":"Gale–Stewart 博弈与策略","display":"df-gale-stewart — Gale–Stewart 博弈与策略","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-gale-stewart","aliases":["20-df-gale-stewart"],"display":"df-gale-stewart — Gale–Stewart 博弈与策略","chapter":"15","section":"15.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§15.1 的博弈定义","source_pdf_pages":[246],"source_printed_pages":[217],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-gale-stewart"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-gale-stewart</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gale-stewart — Gale–Stewart 博弈与策略"},{"key":"chapter","html":"15"},{"key":"section","html":"15.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§15.1 的博弈定义"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>246</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>217</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{I,II\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{I,II\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_I=\\{\\sigma:|\\sigma|\\text{ 为偶数}\\}\">\\(H_I=\\{\\sigma:|\\sigma|\\text{ 为偶数}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{II}=\\{\\sigma:|\\sigma|\\text{ 为奇数}\\}\">\\(H_{II}=\\{\\sigma:|\\sigma|\\text{ 为奇数}\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gale\\text{-}stewart}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nG(A):\\quad I\\text{ 选 }X(0),\\ II\\text{ 选 }X(1),\\ I\\text{ 选 }X(2),\\ldots,\\qquad I\\text{ 胜}\\Longleftrightarrow X\\in A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Follows}_i(X,s)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\ [X\\upharpoonright n\\in H_i\\Rightarrow X(n)=s(X\\upharpoonright n)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\ns:H_I\\to2\\land\\forall X\\ [\\operatorname{Follows}_I(X,s)\\Rightarrow X\\in A],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\ns:H_{II}\\to2\\land\\forall X\\ [\\operatorname{Follows}_{II}(X,s)\\Rightarrow X\\notin A].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gale\\text{-}stewart}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nG(A):\\quad I\\text{ 选 }X(0),\\ II\\text{ 选 }X(1),\\ I\\text{ 选 }X(2),\\ldots,\\qquad I\\text{ 胜}\\Longleftrightarrow X\\in A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Follows}_i(X,s)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\ [X\\upharpoonright n\\in H_i\\Rightarrow X(n)=s(X\\upharpoonright n)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\ns:H_I\\to2\\land\\forall X\\ [\\operatorname{Follows}_I(X,s)\\Rightarrow X\\in A],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\ns:H_{II}\\to2\\land\\forall X\\ [\\operatorname{Follows}_{II}(X,s)\\Rightarrow X\\notin A].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>策略是对该玩家全部有限局面的函数；策略集合不是合法 play 的集合。每一步恰添一位，与 BM 的任意长延伸不同。</p>\n<p>来源：§15.1 的博弈定义；印刷页 217；PDF 第 246 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[